\p{Start contributing to Tau Ceti's \strong{GeometricTopology} roadmap: the ladder from manifolds with boundary, collars, handle attachment, connected sums, and tubular neighbourhoods through locally flat embeddings and the annulus theorem, diffeomorphism groups and isotopy extension, knots and links with their presentations and invariants, Dehn surgery, concordance, hyperbolic structures and Mostow rigidity, prime and JSJ decomposition, Heegaard splittings, taut foliations, and triangulations, aiming at the resolved problems of Kirby's list, see [the route map](https://utensil.github.io/formal-land/geotopo/geotopo-route-map.html).}


